{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 605,
  "batch_count": 1697,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "89bbda6948bf092a08e3287e29276a39db038159",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a95ce765c1e05f14334c1ec",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "喔喔！\\n就让你们看看我帅气的地方吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f911f637bff88dacc2edc438cbfe57aa7845c6b1876a23068d600b4bf55414ae",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "63"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42d670556781923e5436517a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这问题问得好！虽然河堤和走廊也很难舍弃，\\n但最棒的地点还是……赛场上！",
      "source_fingerprint": "66451511c11f5c405bae73d1a872ae72fdf5d62afc97ce81c5cf64e966070698",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "630"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47d25ad3189eb3666bd89ce0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那当然！你问为什么？因为我是\\n立于强者之上的优等生！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4745590c0ff5fa9f9bbeafb9e8f24d49ba9780bbe2725d4bd514b7402023db0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "631"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5de9a2c30d2c4ad892ecdcc0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "绕日本一圈的凯旋parade！\\n还能顺便吃本地盒饭，一石二鸟！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d11c66f0298c3b302f1196e322d88fd2864a55119de0b5633eb06644c07c791a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "632"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abb4f5e8c4468c043e7baf9d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "久等了──showtime到啰！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b6cd34aa9fe35f555120b322348142dd93d7dad709edacdfb60d41b8d5aa208",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "633"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11d91639e091b1f2a49e9eef",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "风风才没有紧张啦！所以现在……\\n希望你不要跟风风说话啦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "15a35549fc36169180aff12c0d718498029a79b8cac5c8a2b79d80d2b1d41d42",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "634"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24b290923171122953729f71",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最后直线要是有人敢挡路……风风就在\\n那家伙屁股上留下超深的齿痕啦──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d55a314c337fb05469bfd162dc7bd346876b4e8bb8c4a249c6cae2714d7a9d0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "635"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f5275ada572b1c9f2c340a1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然她们具有相当程度的魔力，\\n但都不是我的对手呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca8a3055ad29fcd8848fb43cbfed2d82fb89a1070aee22a49cdd442db1775f56",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "636"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07b906341699f62dc3a189b0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那当然啰。就算在决赛时我也会让大家见识\\n魔法少女Sweepy的魔法。大爆炸！",
      "source_fingerprint": "04dfe5615a08608b0ab8345d26039a28238dc6b8c82b31274ef777635db4e84b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "637"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59881c8ec24ed69f1c844230",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员正在等待我的胜利。\\n……所以我要赢。绝对要赢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "95ca6b43add6df0fd0603a918ce88f648a6b2f8b43896740659d0d4a3bb868db",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "638"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f3def81f0999bba956c71c5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员的1日独占券吧。\\n真想疗愈再疗愈，尽情地疗愈他～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "753b2503efc2994e58135ff212c74fd9c120dc9caf8de96bfecc94fc06ee07cf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "639"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da063dd883366c51feb30f2c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我想放下自己的身份或称号，\\n以一名赛马娘的身份全力以赴，享受竞赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "552321104744c7acf4577fd2fee661b6e48ac1396915f4baf9a301b1b6e9f566",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "64"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcc35904ec669e8c0fa5376d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "今天的竞赛也会醒目地冲刺☆\\n让大家见识赛马娘偶像一路领先到底的潜力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "356df9d62048aa0c7a1c8373dd898997c08aff5f5e8da65bf211011ac365d6e7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "640"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:249d21061be4f6d8f385f130",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我绝对会赢，所以不能移开视线哟☆\\n要乖乖待在第一排正中央等喔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4ee62b6e4a45e353f231fe5fcd56b0a71d275696c32464410e82e69b7e2165e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "641"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f02cce79125823d03fc0e9e2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的故事也终于来到最高潮……\\n为了有个圆满结局，我会努力的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "13d77d74f67e7257d2059c82dfeb6a99248d7937b6c339e5890e3a92baeaf7e4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "642"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72f8d9b6765da57ef3f9a9de",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我、我是……主角！？那我说不定能成为\\n英雄……不对，是一定要成为英雄！",
      "source_fingerprint": "018b628cf07fd9af4a197b79e41f3a366d4a633bd9c0d08401b53d1a50573379",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "643"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65c2f6cfe509ecd84b91a626",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这可不是佐敦玩笑，而是正经的喔～\\n不过啊，该说是这次让我也认真起来了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "067201b85dc0d828f0b691e654f58354e264538f932e92aa65183a2042dc96d2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "644"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:304ebbd4b13441500324b982",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "大家真的都超强的耶～唉～真是的。\\n我不想输得很难看，那就只能获胜啰～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "91a00ea0274caf4e2b1acd78522ab2693968d30484672b7f8c3c367ab36d0374",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "645"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fefb41a81b796e0a62841bc3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……根本压抑不住。\\n但没有问题……我现在感觉好极了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1321a0064c7ad137c19e01496c1a7dfd90d2d68e177bd4f98a060e0c0340465",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "646"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a695a758a360e5944c894c50",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不会告诉任何人。\\n反正……应该有在看吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "517d349961a16251b9fd3929fbeed109eee59aad053aa081d042573a49f58973",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "647"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1709626cf153050e5869bba7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "跟谁啊……等赢了再考虑。\\n不先获胜就没意义了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f13dcb15e57c56f60197dfa8493020f831b180a4c4e8913f0845d2753e89580e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "648"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fb73778634b30321c68c62f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……我要赢。我会用胜利，\\n来证明自己很强。",
      "source_fingerprint": "16f712d1f204db3c55d8b9199ce71eee5d02e9fd65a760c077137dfe3a144ae7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "649"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0b7d267d2058c62e6aef902",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "观战的时候没有服装规定，\\n自由自在地真的很棒呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c463ebd468c4bd1103b6f415422071eccbeb22876d13725fd31fd7e457941a05",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "65"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c498f8816fec8fc358855d96",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为有各位温暖的声援才使得花蕾开始绽放。\\n希望大家能在一旁守护花蕾盛开的瞬间！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5b7188283d4febe235bd01f5fe633706c5909b90d5f613aeb2adba675bd4931",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "650"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec4732024cd4194e71c4582d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然就算踮起脚尖也还是不够，\\n但即便如此，我还是想追上大家！",
      "source_fingerprint": "28220b643431f80302071d8304c41fb202a852a7b20185c85747687632f0953c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "651"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71e8277e7596ca4e02dd130c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这个嘛，我想要美国人在电视上说的\\n那个叫「小萝卜」的胡萝卜──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "776ba1ae8120f48a9464f49c4c673e5330f612ff71c62175767a6580ccbd2d3d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "652"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d54457cca40963620d79aeb1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "唔～蜜册是什么？怎么办──我没有耶！\\n没有就不能参加决赛吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e9061adfbb2c3a5ece874d02c64364aa14fa28ca6aa9c317b3352b02f30a6a8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "653"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:696b467839be7aaa21734d5c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有句话说「赛马娘，一入闸门便有七敌」，\\n所以每个人都是劲敌！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20ef7f8fc8578115378c159b0bc058c5fef6222fa7a631c959ae9d2ac98fae04",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "654"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6127981e194e0be4207b2f2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "交给我吧！\\n呃嗯，我会像爆竹一样狂奔的──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2158a5ea888b3760f88a8dbedf94a8a3a9343412952efe50329eff493ee44f9d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "655"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:315292a8105fdebdb2995865",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "ああ、まるでヒーローショーみたいだ……\\nピンチの時は応援よろしく頼む！",
      "source_fingerprint": "25937e356df896cb9500e8afcea848ad8bbc7d05b0fb75ac129d56460e565f7e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "656"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23ebd05db7a5670193ee0c21",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "戦い続けるのみさ……。\\nそう、この世にレースがある限りッ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5bd397b5eba10b332088310f1b71251c053ccc89706b14dcc9018c31931e008",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "657"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56de85d14f2aa29d37f0a2b0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真是美丽☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "75bafc61348b902c9dd1e5d672c19d1cef2a9842aa259500df190a35cce59f36",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "658"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad6056bff0f11f3ba1e27cd0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯嗯！尽～量期待吧！\\n我会将美丽传递给大家☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c4a4ba32f0066cb54c1fd2916508f5c7c97173fdda147d2f24b1795915e2a23",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "659"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb0f76ab7957af31de16d977",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是的，竞赛结束后我想吃面上铺满蔬菜\\n然后面的硬度偏硬的拉面当作奖励♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "96ba8a71638dcdbca2267e770ce262c45e88e01eaeaf6b15e50d488a8c5b362f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "66"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e0894fa73ecc057c534cb05",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请收下这个「能与幽灵和肩膀酸痛成为朋友的\\n护身符」！这样就会变成甜蜜的负担吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "58f19653df14c7eb942941a131ee9827b4eda7d0733d1bd6e090dde1b182761f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "660"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0442b1a86cbbac23c8f4f60",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "运气！以及努力！于是我做完了\\n百次参拜！现在的我无懈可击！",
      "source_fingerprint": "21241b31dbe02baa525c6755966c738fb11c64959a53fad41f019a6f13b954df",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "661"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4dcde048c6012ff49ecdbb5a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为欢呼声让人心旷神怡，我就忍不住睡了个\\n午觉，结果睡过头了。多亏如此我精神超好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b0221296f02ad2fbbb37f3fecd2bc6b9c9698adb636ff39c307edd6daa6f5ec",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "662"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d6a6c1de51e172b92bf09ed",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这样啊，必须好好感谢呢。\\n不过我会照自己的风格去跑，仅此而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "99c1ca0fa2de47d035583d8f851f6096fe85c74e0d8254ac3d3720b695d45f4e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "663"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd239dc5d72e203f82ab1366",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是，是的～为了不要妨碍到大家，\\n我会悄悄地第1个抵达终点……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e2dfe675a62a315af294be2a551344c4b392b959f7a9f0064affb4c85163aa9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "664"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a4177df9cb92ceddc45c90a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然像我这样的人，可能最后还是办不到，\\n但还是要相信会有救赎──啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2aa0810556117575e870cda1299941dee97b1b5c159a4c784bc784bd8aa78800",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "665"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c70805dda9b8c4f126a43be",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "完全没有……如果是以前的我应该会\\n这样么说吧。但现在……我稍微有点自信了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "269c16d41e992e98d309a029f1c89e888d3ccaa38f17e68989da223bfddd567a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "666"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46d357ea842382e685b1f4c8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……请看着吧──看着我的表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7b1d1a000a02dd94d4cb4a57c28002e1c299e7e23a79fa5dd857a7b8b9eb5b2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "667"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:544e3e6b9101b59be09aba76",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯──渔网吧？鱼的营养均衡，\\n而且年年有余也能带来好兆头～",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cf3ecc71cbd4114cd18ca2939e17327d717d6226dec1bf09363c3c1b057296f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "668"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4137eb7faabee0fbce94270b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "希望能上榜就好了……\\n锁定的名次……跟大家一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3d8fed6c83a09455f218e9c6c4c7c3f3e7411f04a0d5b72af4d72f1b08dd0de",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "669"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f45ce86c0a1f86f71ac52e8b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不光是眼镜，我身上的所有东西都属于\\n胜利方程式的一环。颜色……则是个人喜好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef08f3973af432628a3041489afd3e7c807f25c94152a388cc360fbaca578532",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "67"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:946ea20c603a058bd175fed8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我会用自己的方式让你们认同。\\n……一定会！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d14458818fa8883e1d8b5ec7b2b9b30c77125e4760ca3cb60af61f3d018af323",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "670"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc6b95717e0a440b914d6b0c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "身为一流这是理所当然的。等着看我获得优胜\\n并成为超一流的赛马娘吧！哦──呵呵呵！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9dc9b1e1a027783f875cdad72efafc37625865976f8e3fbfa45690fe03ddd2ae",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "671"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7000a9c7e91feadfa9a595f8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "觉、觉得很辣……当时因为想确定这不是梦，\\n所以我直接咬了洋葱……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fde817eaba72d9df8a1f2e6817c0c09259c24f32d02e3a4f5145603af9ef3826",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "672"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:279610daaed991c03f5f1846",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯～想对很多人表示感谢。当然，\\n到时候也会一并向他们报告我获得了优胜！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3795f0eb4cb41ec1569fef818d1e40e23e742a54528f8a2aea800e83e920d0e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "673"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4c33dd6d13e90a9b4672a93",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "没有……我是因为单纯喜欢跑步才奔跑的。\\n这点之后也不会改变。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a84f8e67f422b37fa76accb297279f020003c40a0b34ec35b13fdb8150079d1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "674"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f40296e38ecb8e1138b6ca79",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想参加各种竞赛，从中见识还没有\\n看过的景色。试着拜托看看好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf04ae74c7c73bda84b7021ee0740e7ef9d0f50eae3152f9f04c3168617030f5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "675"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59d79dcc9a4507ab4695d9aa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……当然是那些替我加油的所有粉丝们啊！\\n这还用问吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cd958c01631738524264345e610376bd6f01315c11134553967023c05355e46",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "676"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06c9a4d0a356834b3878705b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我接受挑战！我既不会跑也不会躲……\\n不……若被追上还是会跑就是，嘿嘿嘿～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "adba1586e95c49ad0f4f1cd2cc1b16276e31efc3a7afa32b4d0a6475a23ad693",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "677"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:946172bf60126e12b7594d8e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呵呵，我还不会让路给你们喔。\\n有时也勇敢踩下油门奔驰吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "738f51313bc146bc121258d6568e3b2d3c722f2e87accf3cd339391bfd6ac8f3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "678"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5dd5007dedea7110524b2fd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哎呀，全都不能漏看喔？就跟流行一样，\\n瞬间就会被抛在后面的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b970fca6fbe024356b2d9b43f9fd2b76b069114d38d1f405934331da3b3eaeb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "679"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6282ae4c610e5f19a42217c4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "既是挚友也是劲敌……光这样形容还不够。\\n是难以解释的，超越「理论」的存在。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b379d800af018c0ab78b0b73d444aafb26d1af8c5ccf6bb4e43a5d97bcbc746a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "68"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:999024bdeb4997a622bbcdf9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呵呵，你摸摸右边的口袋看看？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a004473ab0e798af219d8f976f2a9f4ef47778e172a9a1326007cba777980c8b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "680"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbe74a38dc04eb6032cbf47c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "感谢大家平常的支持。\\n我会为了你们创造奇迹。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9251d47999dde7c519db829b55a78237a63cd421db622fbf256364b115d888cb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "681"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46dc101d275c2dc99aa3d32b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "鱿鱼……螃蟹……嗯，我都喜欢，\\n尤其是鱿鱼烧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe6644ae559b7f49e8caada3477ff773bcc90b34021c0ee3d44e38b7b94153c1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "682"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:163e348c8d4c233ca763e981",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……无法只用一句话总结。所以希望大家注目\\n于我的表现。我想表达的──应该都在里面。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b355738733ed9a854c6bfed8b2ff65ef52354a93c613b02b6250d421334d4a9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "683"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:caedad0b89b0d9736e0bcae7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然有针对赛道变形机关拟定对策，\\n但我忘记指令是什么了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "093fbf071c3b7be985c99fb685767bce2f30864e141364c3e8677f700f353bfc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "684"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f415a658aa156573bb143a4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "喝──啊！！被我透过函授教育学到的\\n「截拳道」吓得连睡觉都会发抖吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2c632dfbe6804fa08dd34bde3ceeb67b77ae928784d4e8381479080d7290ed5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "685"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:086d08f1ce0a73c990750135",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "还是叫「史上最强」比较帅吧！！\\n啊～如果绣在袖子上会被骂吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5965c2b1925c68ed22aaf16cc5d87f2c97a9a5cd56c242f1f1c075fa0cd62fa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "686"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7e4b28bd3e3047210137d0b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "唔～我不擅长数字这类琐碎的事情。\\n总而言之，我会尽全力冲刺！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd50063056bf4aa166764ba655fca1d419c7dfc9fb194a02612e6545e99b46d5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "687"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aea01e73dc1d7e19c8b80562",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我不认为能轻松拿到第1，\\n所以我比任何人都努力练习！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d35fbac626738e269167b294d76797b505fa2efebc4ca4448be65bb73a29edb0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "688"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d005a925257b8b9959ef250a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……求之不得！请准备刊登\\n「大和赤骥获得优胜」的特辑吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "976c76a9f6f1c19ac04fa014c424f806c01f6a094be6708870e464697f518a08",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "689"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1a216f8a82bdab81e42cb8a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有在研究如何减少空气阻力……\\n你在看哪里？跟我的头无关喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a87a58300b09339e09d419d2f157a82eee0c71def6bea5b7abd1b03501c2d42c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "69"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5239e79e78f83a58f103423f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "像bison那样冲刺！放牛吃草喔！\\nWell……我有说对吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7bdd24c0f388bf79ad4c637e76ad6f32dc24b80eff15d5f4f2ade72bc7ea894",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "690"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2b98ed200c81fd25a01102c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "I'll pass！这些话要与smile\\n和victory一起传达给他们！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbfb5923ba5079b1e23cfce7a6f99301a248bb007fae75723f30ef564a4f89ff",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "691"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:625fbe6feac7be01d28fc992",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "作为对手没有不足之处，\\n我打算以坚定不移的决心来面对。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdf278634c8e8557a5cfafdb022d932231574adbc0e214a51391cf2e761009eb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "692"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1472189ab82af80a678c5c5f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当然已经准备万全。粉丝们所期待的真正实力\\n──现在正是让大家见识的时候。",
      "source_fingerprint": "00ff37cd2f41cfd4b8a2e102ed763d6ef3eea1bc055f4ec029744be3109a7e25",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "693"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5356eed7f58e08e3717b7bb7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "说不会是骗人的，但比起那个……\\n这么激昂的气氛会令人兴奋得坐立难安呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "00e2949ecbe851277dfa7fbf438cf0e66468a248e6261c721793486a949d834f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "694"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d3ed9fe196f8632db3fe055",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我会好好地迎战所有人，\\n尽管上前正面交锋吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "263585c3feec5e52fbaccd449666f0172a926f6288f532e77757822dff591e78",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "695"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80ed3dbdd95acaa9f5555291",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这时候才搞小动作没有用。\\n我只相信过去每天的勤奋练习！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2980962f0d3f2d5ee2c46b711c1a95aafa0cfd896b5d5dd3d8083b1fa988c79",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "696"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22d42c6f1055d147f0f01eea",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当然很兴奋。和日本大赛的全垒打……\\n不，是和跑天皇赏的时候一样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d363793a472b18369b91558435e30823aa33bf5068d549b8c5c6b0143c5df0b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "697"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:822253f6216f47860cb6587b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当然、绝对、一目了然！\\n注定会是神鹰我获得胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfcc5274ef8a30effec8317d89c9134ec410880fa599976b7a973581f0083624",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "698"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3340ebb35e67056c2dd1dbf4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "爸爸、妈妈、训练员……希望世界上的\\n所有人都能在此祝福我～～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "99ae56b7348be053d1140dbf333d575caabc67e2e94b0a32c7c0a6d0d02124c4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "699"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8266444347216d4242637333",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不用说当然有啊♪\\n毕竟我可是最强的赛马娘！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5fe93bbb1b4f029108794728741b06f1dce17b22bc883ecf10242fab7eece92",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a420c2e55ba9952f498f6916",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "人家会赢喔！然后呢～～会把你的视线\\n给抢过来♪做好觉悟吧☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c2400b01f62d541e960ad116b9ab24c052995c3e5fd0fefa9aa1dc52f65852e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "70"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea08b9f3b2507904e792fda5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "希望大家连我的每一个呼吸声都不要错过呢！\\n好，装上麦克风用喇叭放出来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1c72ee3e8308f32f18370929e04c9fd2d92263f4a455a7fbba8545e481cf018",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "700"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
